Our Retail Energy practice&nbsp; are looking for experienced Senior Consultants to join the team.

Our Retail, Networks and Water business unit helps regulated utilities and adjacent&nbsp; organisations improve performance, deliver transformation, and strengthen outcomes for customers. We’re at the heart of these industries, driving meaningful and lasting improvement.

