What you will be doing

• This is an exciting opportunity to work at the forefront of this sector alongside our team of market specialists, broadening your skillset and expertise within retail energy. &nbsp;

• You will work primarily within our Retail Energy go-to-market, while also having the opportunity to contribute to projects across the wider utilities sector where your skills and experience are relevant.&nbsp; &nbsp;

• You will be a trusted advisor for our clients, helping them&nbsp; identify , assess, design and implement solutions to their most complex business challenges. &nbsp;

• You will be a key part of our project teams responsible for scoping and delivering complex, multi-faceted change&nbsp; programmes under challenging market conditions.

• You will work&nbsp; frequently in industry within high-visibility areas, collaborating closely with Baringa and client project teams. &nbsp;

• You will support customer and operational transformation&nbsp; programmes across areas such as billing, debt, affordability, vulnerability, field services, data, digital and regulatory change. &nbsp;

• You will conduct structured analysis, build insight from data and translate findings into clear recommendation

